{"id":"71b12c4980bd2a8a","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-comb-partition-relation.md","title":"ZFC Comb Partition Relation","display":"df-zfc-comb-partition-relation — ZFC Comb Partition Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb-partition-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb-partition-relation","58-df-zfc-comb5-partition-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-comb-partition-relation — ZFC Comb Partition Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb-partition-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb-partition-relation</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-partition-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb-partition-relation — ZFC Comb Partition Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n\\in V\\)</span> (partition parameters)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5PartitionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb5PartitionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^n,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^n,\\mu)\\)</span> (coloring function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\approx\\lambda\">\\(H\\approx\\lambda\\)</span> (equinumerosity, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)\">\\(A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}partition\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\forall c\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^n,\\mu)\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;(H\\approx\\lambda\\land |\\operatorname{ran}(c{\\upharpoonright}[H]^n)|=1))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}partition\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\forall c\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^n,\\mu)\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;(H\\approx\\lambda\\land |\\operatorname{ran}(c{\\upharpoonright}[H]^n)|=1))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}partition\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5PartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}partition\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5PartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-comb5-partition-relation</code> is merged here; it used the same monochromatic-subset partition relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^n,\\mu)$ (coloring function, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H\\approx\\lambda$ (equinumerosity, see [[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 对集合 $A$ 和序数 $\\lambda$，$[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}$，$[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)$，见 [[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5PartitionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^n,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"H\\approx\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}partition\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\forall c\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^n,\\mu)\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;(H\\approx\\lambda\\land |\\operatorname{ran}(c{\\upharpoonright}[H]^n)|=1))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}partition\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5PartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)","display":true}],"bytes":1991,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1644","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-comb-partition-relation.md|58-df-zfc-comb-partition-relation]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","28c79fde9f892bfe","2be08d4ee8aa1590","5582a281f15a33c2"]}